2 CONT '''Alessandro Casati''' was born on March 5, 1881. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34706379621 Gian Alfonso Casati] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34706379638 Luisa Negroni Prati Morosini]. 
